      "raw": "{\"schema_version\":\"structured-answer-1.0\",\"context_id\":\"sha256:efd933f6c4fa724b2554d5f7441a2afb33c071fb113dac0cc8eea863c39f998c\",\"answer\":\"本卦六爻全部为静爻，没有任何动爻，因此也没有变爻，不存在变出的六亲。\",\"direction\":\"unclear\",\"yongshen_candidates\":[],\"factors\":[{\"assessment\":\"neutral\",\"interpretation\":\"初爻至六爻的动爻标记均为否，说明本卦六爻皆为静爻，没有动爻。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"fact:/lines/0/moving\",\"fact:/lines/1/moving\",\"fact:/lines/2/moving\",\"fact:/lines/3/moving\",\"fact:/lines/4/moving\",\"fact:/lines/5/moving\"]},{\"assessment\":\"neutral\",\"interpretation\":\"六爻的变爻记录均未记载，与没有动爻、无可变出的六亲相符。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"fact:/lines/0/changed\",\"fact:/lines/1/changed\",\"fact:/lines/2/changed\",\"fact:/lines/3/changed\",\"fact:/lines/4/changed\",\"fact:/lines/5/changed\"]}],\"timing_candidates\":[],\"uncertainties\":[\"本次仅核对动爻有无及变出六亲的记载情况，不涉及用神、成败或其他六亲。\"]}",
